# Two players and 10 drones, a single race on track 0 in split screen (docs/port/MORECARS.md 10.3): game.cars at
# 12 and the Drones option raised from 5 to 10 through the track select's menu. The check: 12 cars in the race, at
# places 0-11, each moved, and both views drawn (tools/port/cars_check.py, synth_shot.py).
# until: 0x400000:600
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 2, windows 2, cars 12, mode 0, track 0
# args: --set game.cars=12 --log-cars --screenshot-at 1400 --screenshot race2p12.png
# check: tools/port/cars_check.py race2p12.log 12 --shot race2p12.png 2
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
9 RIGHT 0.1    # the main menu's first option: one player more (as many as controllers)
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen: each player is ready
14 A@2
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 DOWN 0.1    # the track select: down its options list to the Drones
20.5 DOWN 0.1
21 RIGHT 0.1   # the Drones: 5 to 10
21.5 RIGHT 0.1
22 RIGHT 0.1
22.5 RIGHT 0.1
23 RIGHT 0.1
25 A           # track 0
28 A           # the car select: each player's car
28 A@2
32 A 15        # gas for 15 s, each player
32 A@2 15
